Application Name: 
	MatchFlix!
	
Application Description:
	Unlike other movie rating aggregator sites like Rotten Tomato and IMDb, MatchFlix will be focused on the social aspects of being a movie goer. Our primary distinction from the others will be a feature that allows users to find others with similar movie tastes so they can enjoy a movie together.
	
Audience
	Anyone who likes movies (most people).
	
Vision Statment
	For all movie lovers, who are perpetually lonely and looking for people with similar tastes. MatchFlix is an app that will connect them to the people they look for. Unlike IMDb and others, we will not have a bunch of uptight critics emotionlessly judging the movies, our product will actually have a social aspect to our service.

